        77.66929626464844,
        276.834228515625,
        486.75177001953125,
        291.3872375488281
      ],
      "text": "7.1 In patients with rifampicin-resistant tuberculosis (RR-TB) or multidrug-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        288.9442138671875,
        510.677734375,
        303.3872375488281
      ],
      "text": "(MDR-TB), elective partial lung resection (lobectomy or wedge resection) may be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        300.9442138671875,
        323.9054260253906,
        315.3872375488281
      ],
      "text": "alongside a recommended MDR-TB regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
