    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        315.92022705078125,
        389.42132568359375,
        331.584228515625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.3166198730469,
        216.29168701171875,
        364.1686096191406
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.3764953613281,
        374.89404296875,
        385.81951904296875
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation in this section addresses one PICO question:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.47807312011719,
        391.8044128417969,
        515.8995361328125,
        407.4684143066406
      ],
      "text": "(DR-TB, 2016): Among patients on MDR-TB treatment, are the following two  PICO question",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        405.0045166015625,
        515.9163208007812,
        420.66851806640625
      ],
      "text": "interventions (delay in start of treatment and elective surgery) likely to lead to cure and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        418.2044982910156,
        140.27297973632812,
        433.8684997558594
      ],
      "text": "outcomes? 60",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.1844177246094,
        527.533203125,
        455.62744140625
      ],
      "text": "Surgery has been employed in treating TB patients since before the advent of chemotherapy. In many",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977176666259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.3843994140625,
        527.4367065429688,
        468.8274230957031
      ],
      "text": "countries, it remains one of the treatment options for TB. With the challenging prospect in many",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.58441162109375,
        527.2376708984375,
        482.0274353027344
      ],
      "text": "settings of inadequate regimens to treat DR-TB, and the risk of serious sequelae, the role of pulmonary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961483001708984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.7843933105469,
        527.2496337890625,
        495.2274169921875
      ],
      "text": "surgery is being re-evaluated as a way to reduce the amount of lung tissue with intractable pathology",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981184005737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.9844055175781,
        527.385009765625,
        508.42742919921875
      ],
      "text": "and reduce bacterial load, and thus improve prognosis. The review for this question was based on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.1844482421875,
        527.45654296875,
        521.62744140625
      ],
      "text": "both an IPD meta-analysis to evaluate the effectiveness of different forms of elective surgery as an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.1083984375,
        527.4249267578125,
        534.827392578125
      ],
      "text": "(137) adjunct to combination medical therapy for MDR-TB  , and a systematic review and study-level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.3084106445312,
        527.417724609375,
        548.0274047851562
      ],
      "text": "(138). meta-analysis   Demographic, clinical, bacteriological, surgical and outcome data of MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.784423828125,
        527.1625366210938,
        561.2274169921875
      ],
      "text": "patients on treatment were obtained from the authors of 26 cohort studies that supplied data for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996249198913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.7083740234375,
        527.48681640625,
        574.4273681640625
      ],
      "text": "(70) adult IPD (aIPD)  . The analyses summarized in the GRADE tables consist of three strata comparing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.984188079833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.1844482421875,
        527.5379638671875,
        587.62744140625
      ],
      "text": "treatment success (e.g. cure and completion) with different combinations of treatment failure, relapse,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97938060760498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.3843994140625,
        527.4135131835938,
        600.827392578125
      ],
      "text": "death and LTFU. Two sets of such tables were prepared, one for partial pulmonary resection and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.5844116210938,
        527.3902587890625,
        614.0274047851562
      ],
      "text": "one for pneumonectomy. Based on an assessment of the certainty of the evidence, carried out using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.784423828125,
        527.429931640625,
        627.2274169921875
      ],
      "text": "predefined criteria and documented in GRADEpro, the certainty of the evidence was rated as very",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.984375,
        405.5587463378906,
        640.4273681640625
      ],
      "text": "low to low, depending on the outcome being assessed and type of study.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.6882934570312,
        527.4353637695312,
        662.1312866210938
      ],
      "text": "In the study-level meta-analysis that examined all forms of surgery together, there was a statistically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.8883056640625,
        527.4408569335938,
        675.331298828125
      ],
      "text": "significant improvement in cure and successful treatment outcomes among patients who received",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.0883178710938,
        527.5785522460938,
        688.5313110351562
      ],
      "text": "surgery. However, when the aIPD meta-analysis examined patients who underwent partial lung",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.288330078125,
        527.4389038085938,
        701.7313232421875
      ],
      "text": "resection and those who had a more radical pneumonectomy compared with patients who did not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.48828125,
        527.5891723632812,
        714.9312744140625
      ],
      "text": "undergo surgery, those who underwent partial lung resection had statistically significantly higher rates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970459938049316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.6882934570312,
        527.3903198242188,
        728.1312866210938
      ],
      "text": "of treatment success. Patients who underwent pneumonectomy did not have better outcomes than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.8883056640625,
        527.3958129882812,
        741.331298828125
      ],
      "text": "those who did not undergo surgery. Prognosis appeared to be better when partial lung resection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.8717041015625,
        526.3604125976562,
        763.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "The outcomes comprise 1. Cured/completed by end of treatment, 2. Culture conversion by 6 months, 3. Failure, 4. Relapse, 5. Survival (or  60",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.977468013763428,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6716918945312,
        524.2335205078125,
        773.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "death), 6. Adverse reactions (severity, type, organ class), and 7. Adherence to treatment (or treatment interruption due to non-adherence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.967182636260986,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
